{{distinguish|1974 FIFA World Cup Group B}}
{{more citations needed|date=May 2018}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 2 of the [[1974 FIFA World Cup]]''' was contested between 13 and 22 June 1974, with matches played in three cities: [[Dortmund]], [[Gelsenkirchen]] and [[Frankfurt]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/74full.html |title=World Cup 1974 finals |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

The group consisted of defending champions [[Brazil national football team|Brazil]], [[Scotland national football team|Scotland]], [[Yugoslavia national football team|Yugoslavia]] and African Cup of Nations winner [[DR Congo national football team|Zaire]].

